      "source": "Simple <code>javax.xml.namespace.NamespaceContext</code> implementation.\nFollows the standard <code>NamespaceContext</code> contract, and is loadable\nvia a <code>java.util.Map</code> or <code>java.util.Properties</code> object",
      "translation": "简单的 `<code>javax.xml.namespace.NamespaceContext</code>` 实现。遵循标准的 `<code>NamespaceContext</code>` 契约，并且可以通过 `<code>java.util.Map</code>` 或 `<code>java.util.Properties</code>` 对象加载。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Bind the given namespace as default namespace.",
      "translation": "将给定的命名空间绑定为默认命名空间。",
      "count": 2
